This file exists so that `//go:embed static` in static_loader.go is
satisfied on a fresh checkout (before `make build-all` / `make deploy-ui`
populates this directory with the Vite build output).

It is intentionally tracked despite `pkg/webui/static/*` being gitignored;
the `!pkg/webui/static/placeholder` exception in .gitignore permits it.

It is never served: readStaticFile looks up named assets (index.html, etc.)
and falls back to webui/dist/ at runtime when the named asset is absent here.
